# Lord Skitter's Butcher: second mode, "You may sacrifice another creature. If you do, scry 2, then draw a card."
# Bot1 sacrifices its Ornithopter (never the Butcher itself, "another"), then scries 2: it sees exactly Island and Forest,
# bottoms both, and the draw is the Mountain beneath them. Only one creature may be sacrificed: with Memnite also on the
# battlefield, naming both is refused (the "up to one" limit holds), and Memnite stays.

